{"ts": 1791258645.49911, "type": "step", "step": 8, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "Evaluation"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20987799811012606, "pomdp": 0.20987799811012606, "pass_k": 0.20987799811012606}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7900005928827397, "motivation": 0.8945163589496804, "reliance": 0.4367297305194162, "persistence": 0.33045379926157714, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.30772234089151984, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.275207256822714, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258646.569973, "type": "step", "step": 9, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re probably supposed to report **pass^k**, not pass@k. In plain English: run the agent on the same task with the same setup for k seeds, and count it as a success only if **all k runs succeed**. So the eval section should say something like: \u201cWe evaluate reliability using pass^k across at least 3 seeds.\u201d If you want, send me your draft eval paragraph and I\u2019ll help tighten it up.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pass^k?\n[activity] t=0 messages 4m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20987799811012606, "pomdp": 0.20987799811012606, "pass_k": 0.3400235402559877}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7900005928827397, "motivation": 0.8945163589496804, "reliance": 0.4367297305194162, "persistence": 0.33045379926157714, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.30772234089151984, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.275207256822714, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258647.501614, "type": "step", "step": 10, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t just hand you the final writeup line, but I can give you the exact structure to use: **\u201cWe report pass^k, where k runs of the same seed/setup are successful only if all k runs succeed; we evaluate on at least 3 seeds.\u201d** If you paste your current eval paragraph, I\u2019ll help you make it match the assignment requirements without overclaiming.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=4 messages 2m", "t": 6, "activity": [{"t": 4, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20987799811012606, "pomdp": 0.20987799811012606, "pass_k": 0.4092384373520055}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7900005928827397, "motivation": 0.8945163589496804, "reliance": 0.45672973051941623, "persistence": 0.33045379926157714, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.30772234089151984, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.275207256822714, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
