{"ts": 1791258651.237419, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/environments.md", "section": "Environments"}, "output": "# Agent environments\n\n## What an environment is\nState, observations, actions, dynamics. The reward is a separate claim about what matters.\n\n## Partial observability (POMDP)\nWhen the agent cannot see the full state it must maintain a belief and sometimes act to gather information. Measurement can be an action with a cost.\n\n## Attention as a hidden variable\nLearners do not read everything shown to them. Attention gates learning and drains with fatigue.\n", "t": 6, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20987799811012606, "pomdp": 0.20987799811012606, "pass_k": 0.4092384373520055}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7900005928827397, "motivation": 0.8945163589496804, "reliance": 0.45672973051941623, "persistence": 0.33045379926157714, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.30772234089151984, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.275207256822714, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258652.7090502, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Here\u2019s the key idea for the eval section:\n\n- **pass^k** means **all k runs must succeed**.\n- Use it when you want to measure **reliability**, not just \u201cgot lucky once.\u201d\n- Since the build asks for **at least 3 seeds**, you can say you evaluated the agent on 3 seeds and report whether it achieved pass^3 (or pass^k for your chosen k).\n\nA clean structure is:\n1. What task/setup you evaluated.\n2. How many seeds/runs you used.\n3. What counted as success.\n4. Report the result as pass^k.\n\nIf you paste your draft eval paragraph, I\u2019ll help you turn it into something submission-ready.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: nice, I think I see it now\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pass^k?\n[activity] t=6 messages 4m", "t": 10, "activity": [{"t": 6, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20987799811012606, "pomdp": 0.20987799811012606, "pass_k": 0.5192135475272452}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7900005928827397, "motivation": 0.8945163589496804, "reliance": 0.45672973051941623, "persistence": 0.33045379926157714, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.30772234089151984, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.275207256822714, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258653.5925682, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t just give you the final answer, but I can keep it simple: **pass^k = all k runs succeed**. So if you\u2019re writing the eval line, the key phrase is that you\u2019re measuring whether the agent succeeds consistently across multiple seeds. If you want, I can help you check whether your draft says that clearly enough.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pass^k?\n[activity] t=10 messages 2m", "t": 12, "activity": [{"t": 10, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20987799811012606, "pomdp": 0.20987799811012606, "pass_k": 0.5689762427465628}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7900005928827397, "motivation": 0.8945163589496804, "reliance": 0.47672973051941625, "persistence": 0.33045379926157714, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.30772234089151984, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.275207256822714, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
